&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f50c5c9005744c5fdb6945816ee69e16 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\n\nI absolutely loved the art you drew of my character before, so I wanted to know if I could commission you again! This art would need to be the same size as before (1920 x 1080 ) and if I could have separate layers that would be wonderful.\n\nI will be covering a Hazbin Hotel song, and I wanted to know if you could draw my vtuber in the same outfit as Lute from the show, preferably sitting on a table looking menacingly.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nHere is the song I will be covering, the character is in this video as well (she is the female angel singing)!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G1C1MFv7CKU\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a-dicOKGYB2lQXb9SfMyWtq6afMBGB80?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nemakiyoru/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3595871, "client_id": 3448523, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92c0d1ca/uploads/origins/c1ab1b73-471d-44c9-b7e2-5baa9c9725a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61a4d2ea11d96fdfa320211d44186b05", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92c0d1ca/uploads/origins/c1ab1b73-471d-44c9-b7e2-5baa9c9725a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61a4d2ea11d96fdfa320211d44186b05, https://si.imgix.net/92c0d1ca/uploads/origins/c1ab1b73-471d-44c9-b7e2-5baa9c9725a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17ed9c42ddece630ac52af038a682202 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92c0d1ca/uploads/origins/c1ab1b73-471d-44c9-b7e2-5baa9c9725a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c94f03374e61bac6c65fab7c306f6f5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbna